          {
            "title": "Multiple values",
            "id": 88373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple'lar, bir fonksiyondan birden fazla değer döndürmemize olanak sağladıkları için kullanışlıdır; örneğin bir listedeki en yüksek ve en düşük puanlar gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon, birden fazla değeri tuple olarak döndürebilir. Değerleri virgülle ayır.</p><p>Önce <code>highest_score</code>, ardından <code>lowest_score</code> döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"max\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"min\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"scores_list\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"highest_score\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lowest_score, highest_score\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return a tuple",
            "id": 88377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir demet döndürmek için döndürmek istediğimiz değerleri virgülle <code>,</code> ayırarak kodlarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>,</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No parentheses",
            "id": 88378,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir demet döndürüyor olsak da parantezler gerekli değildir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>highest_score, lowest_score</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla değer döndürürken onları virgülle ayırırız ve parantez gerekmez.</p><p>Önce <code>highest_score</code>, ardından <code>lowest_score</code> döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores_list\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>highest_score</code>, <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>lowest_score</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store return value",
            "id": 88379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun döndürdüğü demeti depolamak için, her zamanki gibi fonksiyon çağrısının sonucunu <code>data</code> gibi bir değişkene atarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>data</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döndürülen tuple'ı saklamak için fonksiyon çağrısının sonucunu bir değişkene ata.</p><p>Kodun <code>(80, 17)</code> yazdırması için tuple'ı <code>data</code> içinde sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"167\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"169\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"scores\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"min\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"(80, 17)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>data</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>get_scores_data</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Retrieve individual values",
            "id": 88380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından, en yüksek puan için <code>data[0]</code> ve en küçük değer için <code>data[1]</code> gibi, tek tek değerlere indeksleri aracılığıyla erişebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"193\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>highest</code>, ardından <code>data[1]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>En düşük puan, döndürülen demetin <code>1</code> indeksindedir. Kodun <code>smallest score: 17</code> yazdırması için onu <code>smallest</code> değişkeninde sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_scores_data\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(scores_list)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  highest_score = max(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lowest_score = min(scores_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highest_score, lowest_score\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"31\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = get_scores_data(scores)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest = data[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"smallest = data[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;smallest score: \" /><text value=\"{smallest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;highest score: \" /><text value=\"{highest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"219\" /><option startIndex=\"222\" endIndex=\"229\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"smallest score: 17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"highest score: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>smallest</code>, ardından <code>data[1]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a tuple",
            "id": 88381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Demetler değiştirilemez olduğundan, bir demeti değiştirmemiz gerekmeyecek, yalnızca değerleri kullanacağımız durumlarda (bir oyunun kazananlarında olduğu gibi) demet döndürürüz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple'lar değiştirilemez. Bu nedenle değerleri değiştirmeden yalnızca kullanman gerektiğinde tuple döndür.</p><p>Kodun önce <code>First: Sue</code>, sonra Ed ve Ann yazdırması için ilk üç oyuncuyu sırayla döndür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_top_three\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"top_three = get_top_three(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;First: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Second: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Third: \" /><text value=\"{top_three[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players[1], players[0], players[2]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First: Sue\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second: Ed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third: Ann\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>players[0], players[1], players[2]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "When to return a list",
            "id": 88382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir ekip üyesini güncellemek gibi, döndürülen değer koleksiyonunu değiştirebilmek istediğimizde <code>team</code> gibi bir liste <code>return</code> ederiz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"form_team\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(players)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team = []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  team.append(players[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team = form_team(players)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chloe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(team)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Chloe', 'Ann']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return team</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple values",
            "id": 88670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Demetlerin temel kullanım alanlarından biri nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fonksiyonların içinde birden fazla değer döndürme</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Değerleri görüntüleme</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fonksiyonların içinde birden fazla değer döndürme.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Demetlerin temel kullanım alanlarından biri, bir fonksiyondan birden fazla değer döndürmektir.</p><p>Bir fonksiyon hem <code>width</code> hem de <code>height</code> değerini hesaplıyor. Hangi ifade iki sonucu birlikte döndürür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return width, height</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(width, height)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return width</code> ve ardından <code>return height</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return width, height</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return a tuple",
            "id": 88671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyondan birden fazla değer döndürürken farklı değerleri nasıl ayırırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Virgül kullanarak <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Noktalı virgül <code>;</code> kullanmak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Virgül kullanarak <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döndürülen birden fazla değeri virgülle ayırırız.</p><p>Hangi satır <code>lowest</code> ve <code>highest</code> değerlerini doğru şekilde döndürür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return lowest, highest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest; highest</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return lowest highest</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return lowest, highest</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No parentheses",
            "id": 88672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla değer döndürürken parantezlere ihtiyacımız var mı?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, yalnızca değerlerin izlediği <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, her bir değerin etrafında</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, yalnızca değerlerin izlediği <code>return</code> anahtar kelimesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla değer döndürürken paranteze gerek yoktur, yalnızca <code>return</code> ve ardından değerler kullanılır.</p><p><code>return name, age</code> çağıran koda ne döndürür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>name</code> ve <code>age</code> değerlerini içeren bir demet</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>age</code> parantezlerin dışında olduğu için yalnızca <code>name</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her değerin kendi parantezine ihtiyacı olduğu için bir hata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>name</code> ve <code>age</code> değerlerini içeren bir demet.</p></body></html>"
